    21	The Opus verdict is `CONFIRM_WITH_CORRECTIONS`.  It independently rebuilt
    22	the missed-principal-divisor lemma, fixed-sheet theorem, Galois-uniformity
    23	contradiction, rank-two trace-zero proof, and group-theoretic translation.
