   124	```
   125	
   126	## 4. Exact boundary and successor
   127	
   128	Promoted:
   129	
   130	```text
   131	proper Galois block quotient: impossible;
   132	two-block quotient d2=2:       impossible;
   133	every divisorial inertia:      at least one fixed block;
   134	ramification class lattice:    injects into Cl(Y);
   135	different / relative dual:     nonprincipal / nonfree.
   136	```
