+**Exact conditional application.** In the provisional all-`D` constant-J framework take `N=7D`. Its identities give `ord_s[F,G]>=3j`, source target order `8D-2`, and `[R,T]=c s^(8D-2)-[F,G]`. For `D>=3`, the weakened condition `3j>=7D` therefore gives `ord_s[R,T]>=7D`, hence exact `[R,T]=0`. Specializing `s=1` produces the same `f=F(1), g=G(1), r=R(1)` and scalar-polynomial identity used by the provisional direct obstruction. Now `m=3D-j<=2D/3<D`, `deg g<=5D-2j=2m-D`, and nonzero `[f,g]=c` forces `m>D/2`; the direct leading-degree contradiction still applies. Conditional candidate conclusion: every actual source satisfying the entire provisional `3:5`, constant-J, closed-`H`, canonical-reference interface has `3j<7D`, improving the old `j<=floor(7D/3)` only when `3|D`. No source existence, attachment, or global JC2 consequence follows.
+
+**Dependencies and tiers.** The threshold lemma itself is a hand proof at `INTERNAL-UNREVIEWED / PRODUCER-CHECKED` lifecycle. Its application consumes the provisional general reference report and provisional direct obstruction; it does not upgrade either. The charged history contains the strict lemma and explicitly leaves threshold optimality unclaimed, but no exact `>=N` version or this equality composition; classification is `NEW` relative to the frozen packet, with no external novelty claim.
+
+**Cheapest discriminator and time.** One different-model, pure-prose hostile review of the two inductions and the equality application, capped at **20 minutes**; no algebra expansion or computation. Check separately: nonhomogeneous degree splitting, the `ell=n` scalar endpoint, `ord[F,G]>=3j`, and the weak inequalities in the direct lemma.
+
+**Every outcome.** If fully confirmed while the two provisional parents are also confirmed, bank the sharper conditional bound but keep it clientless. If the threshold lemma is refuted, preserve the accepted strict lemma and require an explicit counterobject satisfying all stated hypotheses. If the threshold lemma passes but either parent is gapped, bank only the abstract lemma and quarantine the application. If review is inconclusive, retain this card unpromoted and do not use equality downstream. **Stop condition:** one review cycle; no descendant until a literal source is attached. **Expected information gain:** medium for theorem integrity and the `3|D` boundary, low-to-medium for global resolution because the current source screen has no client.

